<div class="hero"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p style="margin-top:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">Last updated: June 2026</p></div></div>
<div class="page"><div class="container"><div class="card">
<div class="body-text">At HotPlate Technologies Pvt. Ltd. ("HotPlate", "we", "our", "us"), we are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy.</div>
<div class="sec-title">1. Information We Collect</div>
<div class="body-text">We collect information you provide when you register (name, email, phone number, delivery address), place orders (payment details processed securely via third-party gateways), and interact with our platform (device type, IP address, browsing behaviour).</div>
<div class="sec-title">2. How We Use Your Information</div>
<div class="body-text">We use collected data to process and deliver your orders, send order updates and receipts, personalise your experience and show relevant restaurant recommendations, improve our services, and comply with legal obligations.</div>
<div class="sec-title">3. Sharing Your Information</div>
<div class="body-text">We share your delivery address with the restaurant and delivery partner for the purpose of fulfilling your order. We do not sell your personal data to third parties. We may share anonymised aggregate data for analytics purposes.</div>
<div class="sec-title">4. Data Security</div>
<div class="body-text">We implement industry-standard SSL encryption for all data transmissions. Payment information is processed through PCI-DSS compliant payment gateways. We never store full card numbers on our servers.</div>
<div class="sec-title">5. Your Rights</div>
<div class="body-text">You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. To exercise these rights, contact us at hotplate@gmail.com.</div>
<div class="sec-title">6. Contact</div>
<div class="body-text">HotPlate Technologies Pvt. Ltd., BTM 2nd Stage, Bangalore, Karnataka – 560076<br>Email: hotplate@gmail.com &nbsp;|&nbsp; Phone: +91 12345 67890</div>
</div></div></div>
